WEBVTT

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:36.050
<b>The new Gintama anime has been running for half a year.
It's already been half a year? We've finally made it through half a year?</b>

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:40.890
<b>The world may change around us, but 
we're still rolling along here.</b>

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.850
<b>Kodokan Dojo</b>

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:49.500
S-Sis...

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.860
I-I...

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:54.860
I got myself a g-girlfriend!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.870
What? A girlfriend?

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.620
I'm in a relationship with a girl.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:05.550
R-Really?

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.960
I-I see...

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.630
In that case, congratulations, Shin-chan.

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:13.250
You approve of our relationship?!

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.630
I was up all night,
 worrying about telling you.

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:19.580
A-Actually, I brought her here 
so I could introduce you.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:20.100
Huh?

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:23.480
Will you meet her?
 I'll tell her to come in!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.810
Wait! She's here?

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:30.270
Isn't it a little early for this?

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:34.150
Don't worry. She's not that 
fussy about that stuff.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.030
Come in, Momo-san.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.620
Sis!

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:41.610
This is my girlfriend, Momo-san!

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.540
Hello.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:49.540
<b>Love Is Neither Plus Nor Minus</b>

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.170
Right now, Edo is obsessed 
with the new game Love Choris.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.070
In this dating sim,

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:59.510
the game is linked to the real world 
as events progress in real time.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.880
When you start the game in the 
morning, she says good morning.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:02.750
Good morning.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.680
At night, she says good evening, 
and this is only the beginning.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:05.560
Good evening.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:10.290
This game is made so well that 
Edo is filled with boyfriends

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.570
who can't bear to

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.570
<i>spend a minute away from their little lovers.</i>

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.570
Huh, that's not good.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.780
If you waste all your time because

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.780
you can't distinguish 
between game and reality,

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.010
you'll never get a real girlfriend.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.540
Isn't that right, Momo-san?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.960
I wish we could share some 
of our happiness with them.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.670
Here you are.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:35.220
It seems that I'm not wanted 
here, so I'll be making my exit.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.840
Hey, where are you going?!

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:41.380
And I ask you where your brother has gone?

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.350
He's trapped in some dimension 
between game and reality.

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:46.070
He showed up with that thing and said that

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.010
he wanted to introduce me to his girlfriend,

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.350
and he's been like this ever since.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.990
It's okay.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:54.830
When Sadaharu is in heat, he 
keeps humping stuffed animals.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.360
After a while, he'll stop.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:04:00.110
That won't work! Shin-chan 
is in heat all year round!

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.420
You girls don't think much 
of Shinpachi-kun, do you?

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:08.060
Are dating sims supposed 
to turn men into that?

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.120
I wouldn't know.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.670
You see, Otae-san,

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.600
dating sims are games where the

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.130
goal is to score with the many beautiful girls who show up.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.990
Why is this guy showing himself 
like nothing is wrong?

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:21.970
Why is he acting like he's 
been up there the whole time?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:24.560
In other words, this is 
the only way to enjoy love

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:27.890
for men who have no luck with women.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:30.480
You would know, wouldn't you?

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.250
In other words, the worse 
a guy does with girls,

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.170
the more likely he is to 
get hooked on dating sims.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.720
So a super S-class cherry boy like 
Shinpachi-kun will stand no chance.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.490
A super S-class stalker shouldn't be talking.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.790
This game was able to completely 
hook a veteran date simmer like me.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.830
It is difficult to describe the 
destructive powers of this game.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.210
That's what my girlfriend Sayaka-chan said.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:51.970
I'm Sayaka.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.250
Those destructive powers did a number on you.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.740
Th-This can't be!

00:04:55.740 --> 00:05:00.260
Does that mean Shin-chan might 
never return from the dark side?!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.840
Sayaka-chan!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.710
Did you try to make contact?

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:09.850
Yes, I was looking for a chance 
to take the game away from him...

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:11.690
What are you doing?

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.850
Please don't touch Momo-san!

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:19.360
He's so mentally unstable that he 
thinks the game is his girlfriend.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.510
If you want to reach out to him,

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:24.160
you must join him in his little world!

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.740
How do we do that?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.370
That should be obvious.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.720
Welcome to the world of Love Choris.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:34.420
<b>Name</b>

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:34.420
<b>Birthday</b>

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:34.420
<b>Blood Type</b>

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.030
Please begin by inputting your name

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.200
as the name of the main character.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.250
<b>Gintoki Sakata.</b>

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:38.350
Hey! Why do I have to play this crap?!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.010
To bring Shinpachi-kun 
back to the real world.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.390
Don't give me that crap!

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:43.510
That'll take too long!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.390
How am I supposed to get 
hooked on a kiddie game?!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.370
It doesn't matter if you 
get hooked on the game.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.390
You just need to be in 
the same world as he is.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.800
Why don't you go talk to Shinpachi?

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.360
You think Shinpachi-kun 
is going to listen to me?

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.630
First, you need to choose 
one of the three heroines.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.610
Love Choris is a game where 
you win over one of the

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.860
heroines and engage in a

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.410
real-time relationship that 
is amazingly realistic.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.700
The first heroine is Sayaka Otakai-chan.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.020
She is the captain of the railway 
club that you're also in.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.620
An excellent student and athlete

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.490
who's also Isao Kondo-kun's girlfriend.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:19.150
Why are you part of her description?

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:18.790
I sure like you.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.920
You just happened to choose 
her as your heroine.

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.720
The second heroine is Momo Anigasaki-san.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.170
She's one year older than the main character

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:27.030
and the helpful older sister type.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.130
Shinpachi-kun chose her as his heroine.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.280
Why did he choose an older sister character?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.430
That's pretty disgusting.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:33.670
You don't want to choose

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.080
the same heroine or people will get jealous.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:40.510
Which means you're left 
with the third character.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:41.940
Pinko Shiramizu.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.490
Wait a sec!

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:46.450
This character is noticeably 
different from the others!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.710
Pinko-chan is the owner 
of a Chinese restaurant

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:50.140
that the main character frequents.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.860
She's a widow who lost her 
husband, Takuzo, a while back.

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.790
This is obviously Pinko!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.750
It's like she's from a 
totally different world!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.080
Give me Sayaka-chan or Momo-san!

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:02.410
Hmm, but they will be very difficult.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.540
Doesn't matter.

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.060
It feels better when you finally land them!

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:08.720
No, that's not what I mean.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.630
To choose a heroine,

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.310
you have to shoot down the one you want.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.560
Why is it a shooting game?!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.790
And it takes a long time before 
Sayaka-chan or Momo-chan show up.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.240
The hell, it's like I'm 
Making It Through Pinko!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:23.860
Oh, now you've done it.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.990
You're stuck on Pinko-chan's route now.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.920
There is no other route, is there?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.140
How did you guys get normal heroines?!

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.630
Forget it! Let's just get this over with!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:33.620
I'll just win over Pinko!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.620
But first...

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.340
You have to decide what you 
want Pinko-chan to call you.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:39.690
I don't give a damn!

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:42.840
It's more fun if you have her call you by that.

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.050
If she wasn't Pinko, maybe!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.590
Forget it! Gintoki will do!

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.300
This is good enough!

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:49.440
Takuzo.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.140
She's completely ignoring me?!

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.260
She didn't even say my name!

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.140
She's still stuck on Takuzo!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.380
But you can choose between the pronunciations

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.810
Takuzo, Takuzo‘!, and Takuzo“!

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.150
They're all the same!

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.530
The ones on the right are Takuzo.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.120
The ones on the left are Takuzo“!.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.030
Another choice that 
involves a shooting game?!

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:09.020
They're all Takuzo!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.790
Can I just start this game already?!

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:13.780
Okay! I can finally begin!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.340
Right, your next choice is about the

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.600
catchphrase for Pinko-chan's 
child, Enari-kun.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.790
How do you want him to pronounce, 
"That's not helping, okay?"

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:22.290
Enough is enough already!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.030
You're going to become his new father.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:27.050
It's important to build a strong 
relationship with her son.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:31.720
<b>Sengoku BABASAN</b>

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:29.090
<b>That's not helping, okay?</b>

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.440
The right castle is "That's 
not helping, okay?"

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.050
<b>That's not helping, otay?</b>

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.620
The left castle is "That's 
not helping, otay?"

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:31.760
<b>Proceed</b>

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:33.050
<b>Secure Weapons
Secure Provisions</b>

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.050
There's no way I have to 
play a simulation game.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.680
I'm not wasting my time on this shit!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.620
Man, you don't know how to treat a lady.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.810
If you turn off the power without saving,

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.750
your relationship will suffer.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.450
Huh?

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:49.120
For example, my game shut down abruptly when

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:50.550
Otae-san laid the smack down.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.570
When I restart the game...

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.100
Geez...

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.080
You just turned off the game again.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:58.080
What was that for?

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:58.080
Huh? What is this? What is this?

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:02.890
I told you to be gentle.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.090
What's with her? She's throwing a fit.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:08.090
Sorry! Forgive me!

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.090
You want me to forgive you?

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:13.090
Then you have to kiss me ten times.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:14.600
<b>I'm not jealous or anything.</b>

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:18.240
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! 
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.660
I love you, Isao-kun!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.690
And I love you, Sayaka-chan!

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:28.610
Do you understand the capabilities 
of Love Choris now?

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:32.870
They're breathing on the 
other side of the screen.

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:34.910
B-But they're 2D.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.790
You should look at yourself in the 
mirror. I guarantee you'll cry.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.800
Don't be so stubborn.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.120
Apologize and patch up your relationship.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.540
I-It's not worth it.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.420
I mean, my girlfriend is Pinko.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.770
The girls change according 
to the player's preference.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.920
That's the best thing about Love Choris.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.240
She might be Pinko now,

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:56.430
but eventually, she may turn 
into the girl of your dreams.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.520
No, no, no. We're talking 2D here.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.730
Well, I guess...

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:04.440
If you really insist, I 
might give it another shot.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.520
So, what do I do after I turn it on?

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.690
Didn't you see what happened in my case?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.510
My girlfriend gave me the cold shoulder

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.910
because I suddenly turned off the game.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.750
You need to do some sucking up.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.200
That was just despicable how 
you turned off the game.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.090
You're right.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.560
She's so mad that she won't even look at me.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:23.620
That's amazing.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:26.710
It's all your fault... All your fault...

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.710
<b>Her Enari is cold and stiff now.</b>

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:30.820
Hey!

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:33.440
Cold shoulder?! More like cold Enari!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.470
I can't fix this now!

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:40.100
It looks like you were too violent 
when you turned off the game.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.220
Just apologize.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.270
Uh, an apology isn't going to help!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.020
You want me to forgive you?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.960
I-I'm sorry! Please forgive me!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.980
I didn't mean any harm!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:56.030
Then recite the Heart 
Sutra one hundred times!

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:57.780
No!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.730
Why is my Love Choris so different?!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.580
This isn't a dating sim! 
This is Resident Evil!

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:06.050
Her son died.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:09.250
You should wait until she's 
gotten over the loss.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.330
Uh, doesn't this game move in real time?!

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.880
I can't wait two years!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.930
Well, in any case,

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:18.090
keep working on winning 
the heart of Pinko-chan.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.560
Do your best to turn her 
into your ideal girlfriend.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:22.730
Isn't this enough already?

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:26.520
I should be able to communicate 
with Shinpachi now.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:30.870
You really think that this 
will be enough to save

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:34.280
Shinpachi-kun from the world of Love Choris?

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:39.280
<b>Love Choris
The My Wife World Tournament</b>

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.670
You should enter this tournament!

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.280
Th-This is...

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:42.280
The My Wife World Tournament?

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:44.900
Love Choris players from all over the country

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:47.790
will gather to determine 
whose girlfriend is the best!

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.200
You must defeat Shinpachi-kun 
in this tournament.

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:52.660
That is the only way to bring him

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.800
out of his dream and back to the real world.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:58.800
You must shatter his fantasy...

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.300
...by using your own fantasy!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:06.310
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan</b>

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:06.310
Wake up!

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:08.080
It's morning!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.310
How long are you going to sleep?

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.890
Why are you so loud every morning?

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:17.780
I get to decide when I'm going to wake up.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:22.780
It must be nice to wake up 
and go to sleep every day.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:24.980
But my son...

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.540
...will never wake up again!

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:32.790
No more! I've had enough!

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:34.380
Listen to me.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.650
You must keep Love Choris 
by your side at all times,

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.030
including when you're eating and sleeping.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:40.110
This will help strengthen your bond.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.730
I did what he said.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.590
It's already the day of the tournament,

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.390
but there hasn't been any improvement.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.310
Enari is decomposing in real time!

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:51.310
And this woman is cursing me 24/7.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:51.310
I wish you would suffer 
the same fate as my son.

